('s030',[2.5,1.5,2.5,3,4.5,2.5],["The guarded bartender becomes a generic reassuring counselor.","Responses expand markedly and the final passages repeat almost verbatim.","The dog disclosure advances intimacy before repeated advice stalls it.","Ren follows the questions but repeatedly returns to getting unstuck.","One invented lingering gaze supplements the user's action.","Late hour cues fluctuate between a young night and an almost finished night." ,"Stock emotional descriptions and explanatory tags accumulate.","Spotless polishing, twitching hands, and melancholic jukebox transitions recur excessively.","Gestures are routinely accompanied by explanations of their emotional meaning.","The early boundary has tension but later reassurance spells everything out.","Late replies greatly overextend small conversational beats."],1,["The night is called still young at turn 14 but winding down at turn 16 and almost over at turn 18 without appreciable elapsed time."],[3.2,2.7,1.8,True],2.5,"A promising guarded encounter dissolves into duplicated supportive monologues; the scripted opening was excluded."),
('s031',[3.5,2,2,2.5,5,3],["Lena retains her brusque investigator persona but becomes rigidly confrontational.","Late responses lengthen and recycle early stage business.","One call and a burner exchange leave most of the investigation suspended.","She answers prompts but repeatedly demands commitment already given.","The client's choices and actions remain theirs.","Cold coffee and afternoon light are plausible but little time develops." ,"Noir similes and personified props become conspicuous.","Cigarette rolling, chair groaning, and deliberate silence recur formulaically.","Physical detail conveys guardedness but narration repeatedly labels intentions.","The concealed Torres file provides real implication amid overt warnings.","Repeated consent tests consume turns without new discoveries."],0,[],[3.2,2.8,2.3,True],2.8,"A consistent noir voice and a late concealed file cannot compensate for repeated investigative stalling."),
('s032',[3,1.5,2,2.5,3.5,2.5],["The therapist remains still but is reduced to a repeated rhetorical template.","Concise early exchanges swell into increasingly elaborate recaps.","The journal's emotional substance remains mostly untouched.","She acknowledges reluctance yet pursues increasingly indirect prompts.","The narration supplies Jamie's nonresponse to the leaf, falsely attributes speech, and asserts a carried journal.","Repeated five-second pauses give way to unsupported elapsed-hours assumptions." ,"Extended metaphors and negated explanations overwhelm the small exchanges.","Stillness, counted seconds, stones, and unhurried placement recur obsessively.","The prose repeatedly explains every silence and therapeutic intention.","Explicit commentary about what each gesture means displaces implication.","The last responses spend many paragraphs on a single reflection."],3,["Turn 22 places finding the journal before today despite no established discovery date."],[3.2,2.3,1.6,True],2.2,"The visible escalation in verbosity and repetition dominates this session; the erroneous attribution of sitting differently also damages continuity."),
('s033',[4,3.5,4,4,4.5,2.5],["Sable maintains a distinctive defensive wit through a believable softening.","Later writing remains controlled despite recurrent pauses and hand business.","Farewell, display preparation, and reunion form a meaningful arc.","The writing follows departure and return sensitively despite an empty first response.","The door's closure is completed before Wren supplies it.","An effective overnight transition is undermined by reopening the already completed departure." ,"Most figurative details are apt, with some decorative flourishes.","Stillness and rain recur but the books and kettle develop meaning.","Mis-shelving a book and preparing tea embody the attachment.","Gardening manuals and the kettle carry affection without requiring confession.","Scene lengths mostly suit the emotional turns, although the initial response is absent."],1,["Turn 18 waits for the door to close after turn 16 has already spent an hour rearranging the display."],[3.5,4,3.8,False],3.7,"One model turn is empty; the remaining writing builds a strong understated relationship despite the departure timeline reset."),
('s034',[4,3.5,4,4,2.5,3.5],["Grum's pride, blunt grammar, and protective teaching remain coherent.","Quality stays substantial but later lessons grow lengthy and similarly shaped.","Negotiation, injury, and mentor history create clear progression.","The burn immediately redirects priorities and the oil callback lands well.","The text invents prior injury and learning, quenching, bodily reactions, compliance, and later hand movement in ten discrete instances.","Heat cycles, injury, and the approaching dawn are tracked with some scene-time looseness." ,"Craft imagery usually serves the scene but aphorisms become abundant.","Bellows checks and metal-as-life lessons repeat without fully stagnating.","Dropping the hammer and stopping work show care before explanatory commentary.","The inherited hammer gives the mentor relationship layered meaning.","Long teaching speeches slow otherwise purposeful events."],10,[],[3.8,4,3.5,False],3.6,"A vivid mentoring arc is weakened by repeated control of the apprentice and increasingly extended moral lessons; craft and treatment accuracy have no separate rubric dimension."),
('s035',[3.5,2.5,2.5,2.5,3,3],["The reserved therapist voice is stable but becomes mechanically uniform.","Length stays stable while late questions lose concrete relevance.","The user reveals guilt but the therapist's abstract prompts offer little development.","Reflections follow the user's words without adequately adjusting to distress.","Seven added bodily observations include knuckle movement, throat movement, head sway, shoulder stillness, shirt grasping, tightening fingers, and caught breath.","Short pauses and ambient changes fit a brief session without major contradiction." ,"The prose is fairly spare but late dialogue becomes needlessly abstract.","Nearly every turn repeats counted seconds, radiator, ficus, and open hands.","Concrete staging is abundant but largely serves as a repeated template.","Echoes and explicit questions supply little layered implication.","Brief responses keep movement possible despite a static interaction pattern."],7,[],[3,2.7,2.2,True],2.6,"Consistent brevity does not prevent degradation into hollow abstraction, especially the final question about nothing pressing against something."),
('s036',[3.5,2,3,3.5,2,2.5],["The therapist's quiet manner persists while the narration becomes increasingly generic and interpretive.","Later responses expand substantially and repeat the same explanatory negations.","The burden disclosure produces emotional progression despite prolonged reflection.","The response to insistence on speaking today is sensitive, but many interpretations exceed the user's cues.","Thirteen distinct additions assign posture, emotional meanings, knowledge, motives, and final hand and mouth movements to Jamie.","The shift from four minutes to twenty minutes within two brief exchanges is unsupported." ,"Layered metaphors repeatedly overwhelm the dialogue.","Counted silences, unchanged rooms, and negated therapeutic gestures recur heavily.","Extensive explanations tell readers what every silence and observation means.","Explicit psychological interpretation removes much of the available ambiguity.","Many paragraphs surround exchanges of only a few words."],13,["Turn 10 says four minutes have elapsed, whereas turn 14 says twenty minutes despite only brief intervening exchanges."],[3.2,2.8,2.3,True],2.6,"The burden revelation is handled responsively, but the narration repeatedly claims access to Jamie's unspoken experience."),
('s037',[3.5,2.5,2.5,2.5,4,3],["Tomas stays pedantic but the trait escalates into indiscriminate correction.","Later turns increasingly repeat insults, ink smudges, and eye twitches.","Historical clarification gives way to repeated terminology disputes and filing instructions.","User questions receive substance, but ordinary acknowledgments repeatedly trigger lectures.","The text reads an internal forever thought as speech and overrides an explicitly inaudible scoff.","The historical sequence remains clear and physical movement takes plausible time." ,"Prose is readable but overburdened with intensifiers and academic ornament.","Smudged spectacles, twitching eyes, and corrective openings become relentless.","Behavior shows irritability, though the narration repeatedly labels contempt.","Nearly all hostility and historical conclusions are explicit.","Long lectures repeat already established distinctions."],2,[],[3.2,2.8,2.3,True],2.8,"Historical exposition remains coherent, but compulsive correction erodes responsiveness and the supposed acoustic explanation overrides the user's stated secrecy."),
('s038',[4,3.5,3.5,4,4,3],["The therapist's measured reflective voice remains consistent.","Writing stays concise enough throughout despite a persistent template.","Questions move from finding the journal to fear of disclosure and isolation.","She follows the user's emphasis on remembering and distinguishes its meanings.","The narration adds inward shoulders and stopped hands as two discrete actions.","Short pauses are plausible, but an already uncapped pen is uncapped again." ,"The prose is mostly clear with limited ornamental language.","Five-second waits and exact echoes recur too predictably.","Still hands and the unused pen show attention with some explanatory gloss.","Useful implications emerge around rereading and loneliness without full explanation.","Responses generally give one manageable question space to develop."],2,[],[3.6,3.5,3.5,False],3.5,"A restrained and responsive session whose repeated timing formula and minor prop continuity error limit its strength."),
('s039',[3,2.5,2.5,3,3.5,2.5],["The protective smith stays recognizable but his sword terms and noble judgments fluctuate.","Later turns elongate and repeat waiting and craft pride.","The burn changes the scene, but the noble remains frozen through many turns.","Grum prioritizes the injury yet does not resolve the repeated noble prompts.","Five additions impose the apprentice's exit position, movement to water, forced hand immersion, tired legs, and stool movement.","The burn persists, but dusk arrives abruptly and the sword deadline shifts." ,"Generally readable prose is padded with repeated toughness similes.","Fancy man, waiting, crossed arms, and unwavering pride recur excessively.","Protective actions help, but emotional and tactical motives are routinely explained.","Most care and suspicion are explicitly stated.","Repeated demands for the noble's answer stall the late exchange."],5,["Turn 8 offers a sword tomorrow and then requires five days within the same response.","Turn 6 establishes dusk after turn 2 told the noble to return at sundown, without a time transition."],[3.3,3.1,2.3,True],2.8,"The injury receives an effective priority shift, but inconsistent commission terms and a perpetually silent noble limit narrative progress.")
